== subscriptions
-- subscriptions 'subscriptions.tsv'
   acme-pro: monthly, billed on the last day the month allows
     starts 2024-01-31, every P1M (1 month, 0:00:00), grace P3D
     renewal 1: 2024-02-29, due by 2024-03-03
     renewal 2: 2024-03-29, due by 2024-04-01 (period x 2 from the start gives 2024-03-31)
     renewal 3: 2024-04-29, due by 2024-05-02 (period x 3 from the start gives 2024-04-30)
     renewal 4: 2024-05-29, due by 2024-06-01 (period x 4 from the start gives 2024-05-31)
     renewal 5: 2024-06-29, due by 2024-07-02 (period x 5 from the start gives 2024-06-30)
     renewal 6: 2024-07-29, due by 2024-08-01 (period x 6 from the start gives 2024-07-31)
     covered P180D (180 days, 0:00:00)
   globex: monthly from a datetime
     starts 2023-11-30T09:00:00Z, every P1M (1 month, 0:00:00), grace P1DT12H
     renewal 1: 2023-12-30T09:00:00Z, due by 2023-12-31T21:00:00Z
     renewal 2: 2024-01-30T09:00:00Z, due by 2024-01-31T21:00:00Z
     renewal 3: 2024-02-29T09:00:00Z, due by 2024-03-01T21:00:00Z
     renewal 4: 2024-03-29T09:00:00Z, due by 2024-03-30T21:00:00Z (period x 4 from the start gives 2024-03-30T09:00:00Z)
     covered P120D (120 days, 0:00:00)
   initech: yearly from a leap day
     starts 2024-02-29, every P1Y (1 years, 0:00:00), grace P14D
     renewal 1: 2025-02-28, due by 2025-03-14
     renewal 2: 2026-02-28, due by 2026-03-14
     renewal 3: 2027-02-28, due by 2027-03-14
     renewal 4: 2028-02-28, due by 2028-03-13 (period x 4 from the start gives 2028-02-29)
     renewal 5: 2029-02-28, due by 2029-03-14
     covered P1826D (1826 days, 0:00:00)
   hooli: quarterly
     starts 2024-03-15T12:00:00+05:30, every P3M (3 months, 0:00:00), grace P7D
     renewal 1: 2024-06-15T12:00:00+05:30, due by 2024-06-22T12:00:00+05:30
     renewal 2: 2024-09-15T12:00:00+05:30, due by 2024-09-22T12:00:00+05:30
     renewal 3: 2024-12-15T12:00:00+05:30, due by 2024-12-22T12:00:00+05:30
     renewal 4: 2025-03-15T12:00:00+05:30, due by 2025-03-22T12:00:00+05:30
     renewal 5: 2025-06-15T12:00:00+05:30, due by 2025-06-22T12:00:00+05:30
     covered P457D (457 days, 0:00:00)
   umbrella: fortnightly
     starts 2024-01-01, every P14D (14 days, 0:00:00), grace P2D
     renewal 1: 2024-01-15, due by 2024-01-17
     renewal 2: 2024-01-29, due by 2024-01-31
     renewal 3: 2024-02-12, due by 2024-02-14
     renewal 4: 2024-02-26, due by 2024-02-28
     renewal 5: 2024-03-11, due by 2024-03-13
     renewal 6: 2024-03-25, due by 2024-03-27
     covered P84D (84 days, 0:00:00)
   stark: a month and a half
     starts 2024-05-31, every P1M15D (1 month, 15 days, 0:00:00), grace P0D
     renewal 1: 2024-07-15, due by 2024-07-15
     renewal 2: 2024-08-30, due by 2024-08-30
     renewal 3: 2024-10-15, due by 2024-10-15
     renewal 4: 2024-11-30, due by 2024-11-30 (period x 4 from the start gives 2024-11-29)
     covered P183D (183 days, 0:00:00)
   wayne: half-yearly
     starts 2024-08-31, every P6M (6 months, 0:00:00), grace PT12H
     renewal 1: 2025-02-28, due by 2025-02-28
     renewal 2: 2025-08-28, due by 2025-08-28 (period x 2 from the start gives 2025-08-31)
     renewal 3: 2026-02-28, due by 2026-02-28
     covered P546D (546 days, 0:00:00)
   tyrell: fractional months are refused
     starts 2024-01-15, every P1.5M (1 months, 0:00:00), grace P1D
     error: ValueError: fractional years or months not supported for date calculations
   cyberdyne: monthly plus an hour
     starts 2024-12-31T23:30:00-08:00, every P1MT1H (1 month, 1:00:00), grace PT30M
     renewal 1: 2025-02-01T00:30:00-08:00, due by 2025-02-01T01:00:00-08:00
     renewal 2: 2025-03-01T01:30:00-08:00, due by 2025-03-01T02:00:00-08:00
     renewal 3: 2025-04-01T02:30:00-08:00, due by 2025-04-01T03:00:00-08:00
     covered P90DT3H (90 days, 3:00:00)
   soylent: fourteen months
     starts 2024-06-30, every P1Y2M (1 years, 2 months, 0:00:00), grace P0D
     renewal 1: 2025-08-30, due by 2025-08-30
     renewal 2: 2026-10-30, due by 2026-10-30
     renewal 3: 2027-12-30, due by 2027-12-30
     covered P1278D (1278 days, 0:00:00)
   oscorp: thirty days, as hours
     starts 2025-01-31, every P30D (30 days, 0:00:00), grace P1D
     renewal 1: 2025-03-02, due by 2025-03-03
     renewal 2: 2025-04-01, due by 2025-04-02
     renewal 3: 2025-05-01, due by 2025-05-02
     covered P90D (90 days, 0:00:00)
   nakatomi: bad start
     error: ValueError: day is out of range for month
== incidents
-- incidents 'incidents.tsv'
   api: across the DST change, written with offsets: down PT1M45S (0:01:45), budget PT45M, within budget
   api: short blip: down PT7M30.25S (0:07:30.250000), budget PT45M, within budget
   api: basic format: down PT2H30M (2:30:00), budget PT45M, over by PT1H45M
   db: across midnight: down PT30M (0:30:00), budget PT1H, within budget
   db: week dates: down PT1H15M (1:15:00), budget PT1H, over by PT15M
   db: ordinal dates: down PT42M0.5S (0:42:00.500000), budget PT1H, within budget
   web: local times: down PT30M (0:30:00), budget PT20M, over by PT10M
   web: naive and aware: error: TypeError: can't subtract offset-naive and offset-aware datetimes
   web: resolved in another zone: down PT59M (0:59:00), budget PT20M, over by PT39M
   web: resolved before it started: down -PT1H (-1 day, 23:00:00), budget PT20M, within budget
   queue: long outage: down P1DT1H30M0.530865S (1 day, 1:30:00.530865), budget P1D, over by PT1H30M0.530865S
